{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pSced7OgxdjvlhrKpSfHdA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:13.053549+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pSced7OgxdjvlhrKpSfHdA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/C7hRSXFxpOUN2S8cM8GdpgHH35uxbVojoicl5eBoAhOIhbrznyvT0VCXROH8qMyKZQ9d5rUGlFRDAMGTh648stA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>香港中文大学（深圳）数据科学学院2025年</span><strong><span>【AI探索未来｜科技新星优先录取营】</span></strong><span>面向中国内地高校大三优秀学子，旨在全国范围内选拔具有卓越潜力的大学生，提前发放预录取Offer。申请人无需本科院校的推免资格。</span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>金融工程硕士项目第二轮报名截止日期为7</span><span><span>月20日</span></span><span>！</span></strong></em></span></p><p><span>还在犹豫的同学，抓紧时间把握机会，加入我们，共同探索AI的未来！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>优先录取营抢先知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>想提前体验理想院校的学习生活？想与行业大咖和优秀同龄人深度交流？还想抢占先机，拿下预录取名额与丰厚奖学金？这一切的机会就在眼前！</span></p><p><span>本次优先录取营不仅是你了解学校、项目与城市的窗口，更是展示自我、规划未来的绝佳平台。我们特别邀请了港中大（深圳）数据科学学院助理院长</span><strong><span>茅剑锋教授</span></strong><span>，为你带来本次活动的权威解读，解答所有关键信息！</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section><p><span>视频来源：</span><span>@寄托天下</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q：数据科学学院的优先录取营（原硕士夏令营）已连续举办多届，您认为对同学们的主要助益体现在哪些方面？ </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jiakDuamoiczIzF2J8SVU0daXf1W75DCVf5nuiazXia9jRFS7JnIdCjfyM0enM9xaCPpTx5JeCy3XiaNVMme6tDMU1Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/C7hRSXFxpOU6dJs2O9vfJUZ53FeAbKU73kP8TicOjSdNRsBV5lz3HbFIJNnzgxUlQlRhozIDznWn905y5byhcKQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>茅剑锋教授</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFwYr2B8hwibWTDKtTUmiaYzxSGFHPjJcjAficKOxhtTQHnkNmeT2OiaGxo1syTcPj1dXjtzL04cWbAiayVibOmN4n9Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“首先，营员可借此拓展社交网络，提前了解学院的授课型项目、校园环境、学院的课程体系及育人理念，并深度感受深圳作为‘未来科技之城’的发展活力；其次，为入营的同学提供提前录取、提前争取高额奖学金的机会。也助力同学们探索职业发展的更多可能性。 ”</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q：参加7月份的优先录取营是否有助于获取入学奖学金及2026年预录取资格？</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jiakDuamoiczIzF2J8SVU0daXf1W75DCVf5nuiazXia9jRFS7JnIdCjfyM0enM9xaCPpTx5JeCy3XiaNVMme6tDMU1Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/C7hRSXFxpOU6dJs2O9vfJUZ53FeAbKU73kP8TicOjSdNRsBV5lz3HbFIJNnzgxUlQlRhozIDznWn905y5byhcKQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>茅剑锋教授</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFwYr2B8hwibWTDKtTUmiaYzxSGFHPjJcjAficKOxhtTQHnkNmeT2OiaGxo1syTcPj1dXjtzL04cWbAiayVibOmN4n9Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“是的。优先录取营属于2026年秋季入学的提前招生及录取批次，参营的同学在优先录取营期间通过所申请项目的考核，将直接获得2026年预录取。根据历年的招生政策，各项目会设置各种类型的入学奖学金，涵盖高达31.8万的全额奖学金及半额奖学金等。 ”</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q：您能为同学们在参与优先录取营期间，特别是与教授交流或面试考核环节，提供一些建议吗？</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jiakDuamoiczIzF2J8SVU0daXf1W75DCVf5nuiazXia9jRFS7JnIdCjfyM0enM9xaCPpTx5JeCy3XiaNVMme6tDMU1Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/C7hRSXFxpOU6dJs2O9vfJUZ53FeAbKU73kP8TicOjSdNRsBV5lz3HbFIJNnzgxUlQlRhozIDznWn905y5byhcKQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>茅剑锋教授</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kFwYr2B8hwibWTDKtTUmiaYzxSGFHPjJcjAficKOxhtTQHnkNmeT2OiaGxo1syTcPj1dXjtzL04cWbAiayVibOmN4n9Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“建议营员在参营期间主动与学院的教授及面试官交流学术问题，在考核环节中充分呈现专业素养、科研潜力及综合能力。我们的夏令营筛选标准要高于常规批次，入围优先录取营足已证明同学们在本科阶段的卓越表现，希望同学们自信从容，以轻松的心态参加我们优先录取营，并在最终考核中取得优异成绩。期待每位营员都能在活动中收获难忘的学习体验。”</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>数据科学学院：人工智能科研与教学基地</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>数据科学学院是香港中文大学（深圳）</span><strong><span>人工智能研究与教学的核心基地</span></strong><span>，全面覆盖计算机科学、统计学、大数据科学等人工智能基础教育领域。学院拥有一支</span><strong><span>国际化、顶尖化的师资团队</span></strong><span>，包括90余位来自世界各地的全职教授，其中超过35%的教授是院士、会士或全球顶尖科学家。他们在机器学习、自然语言处理、计算机视觉等人工智能前沿领域拥有卓越的学术成就，并在国际学术界和工业界产生了深远影响。</span></p><p><span>数据科学学院的硕士项目</span><strong><span>紧密结合人工智能技术发展的最新趋势</span></strong><span>，涵盖多个前沿领域，包括数据科学、金融工程、人工智能与机器人、计算机科学和统计学。学院坚持以全球视野和实践需求为导向，通过系统化的课程设计，培养学生扎实的学术基础与灵活的跨学科应用能力，使其能够在快速变化的科技行业中脱颖而出。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>参与优先录取营，您将获得以下机会</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>01</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>提前锁定2026年入学Offer</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次优先录取营包含以下五大授课型硕士项目，均紧扣人工智能及相关学科的核心发展方向，为学子提供广阔的发展平台：</span></p><p><span>▪️</span><strong><span>计算机科学硕士项目</span></strong><span>：聚焦计算机科学与人工智能的前沿技术，培养技术专家与行业创新者；</span></p><p><span>▪️</span><strong><span>统计学硕士项目</span></strong><span>：聚焦统计学与数据科学及人工智能的深度融合；</span></p><p><span>▪️</span><strong><span>数据科学硕士项目</span></strong><span>：QS排名全国第一、亚洲第三；</span></p><p><span>▪️</span><strong><span>金融工程硕士项目</span></strong><span>：与香港中文大学紧密合作，注重数据科学与金融市场的深度融合；</span></p><p><span>▪️</span><strong><span>人工智能与机器人硕士项目</span></strong><span>：聚焦人工智能与机器人技术的交叉创新，紧贴全球科技发展热点。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>02</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>高达全额的丰厚入学奖学金</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>对于考核表现优异的申请人，学院将提供包括全额奖学金、半奖及其他不同等级的奖学金支持，助力优秀学子实现学术深造的梦想。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>03</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>名师课堂与沉浸式学习体验</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>参与名师课堂，沉浸式感受香港中文大学（深圳）的教学模式，与国际一流教授面对面交流，洞悉人工智能与数据科学的学术前沿与行业应用。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>04</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><b><span>学长学姐经验分享</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>聆听优秀学长学姐的真知灼见，了解他们的求学经历与职业发展路径，为您的人生规划提供宝贵的参考。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>05</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>与优秀同辈同行</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>在高水平的学术氛围中，与来自全国的优秀学子共同学习和成长，激发潜能，共同探索人工智能与数据科学的无限可能。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请指南</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请要求</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请者需同时符合以下三个条件：</span></p><p><span>1. 内地高校本科三年级学生（2026年应届毕业生），不限专业；</span></p><p><span>2.  “985工程” / “211工程”院校的学生，本科前5学期成绩排名在专业或年级的前30%；非 “985工程” / “211工程” 院校的学生，本科前5学期成绩排名在专业或年级的前10%；个别高水平大学可适当放宽标准；</span></p><p><span>3. 英语水平要求：英语四级550分；或英语六级520分；或雅思（学术类）6.5（考试中心/Online）；或托福79（机考/Home Edition）；或GMAT Band 21（Verbal）；或GMAT Focus Edition Band 78 （Verbal）；或其它可证明英文水平的考试。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.  扫描件：本科前5个学期在校成绩单（校级公章）</span></p><p><span>*申请者需上传官方开具的完整成绩单及绩点计算说明扫描件，若成绩单上无平均绩点或者无均分体现，则请同时上传一份学校开具的官方均分（加权平均分）证明。多份文件建议合成一份以PDF格式上传。</span></p><p><span>2.  扫描件：本科前5个学期在校成绩排名（由院系/教务部门盖章）</span></p><p><span>3.  扫描件：相关英语能力资格证书复印件，如英语四级、六级、托福、雅思、GMAT等</span></p><p><span>4.  个人陈述（英文）：600字左右</span></p><p><span>5.  个人简历（中英文）</span></p><p><span>6.  至少两封推荐信：</span><span><span>系统会自动发送推荐信提交说明邮件至推荐人邮箱，推荐人按照邮件说明提交推荐信，推荐信需有推荐人签名。数据科学理学硕士项目要求至少一位学术推荐人。</span></span></p><p><span>7.  扫描件：其他证明材料，</span><span><span>如在读证明、身份证正反面、已发表的论文复印件、奖状复印件、各类证书复印件等。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请人须登录申请系统在线提交申请材料。</span></span></p><p><span>申请系统：https://pgapply.cuhk.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>数据科学、人工智能与机器人、计算机科学、统计学</span></strong></span></p><p><span>申请截止    2025年6月20日23:59（已截止报名）</span></p><p><span>活动时间     2025年7月</span></p><p><span>活动地点     深圳</span></p><p><em><span><br/></span></em></p><p><em><span>*人工智能与机器人项目新增线上场次，线上场次申请截止时间为6月30日23:59，具体活动安排请以各项目邮件通知为准。</span></em></p><p><span>————————————————————</span></p><p><span><strong><span>金融工程</span></strong></span></p><p><span>申请截止    <span> 2025年7月20日23:59（正在报名中）</span></span></p><p><span>活动时间     2025年8月</span></p><p><span>活动地点     深圳</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><em><span>* 注意事项：</span></em></p><p><em><span>1.   具体考核流程后续各项目会通过邮件形式发送给材料审核通过的入营者。申请人可在申请系统中查看申请状态。</span></em></p><p><em><span>2.   优先录取营申请无需本科院校推免资格。</span></em></p><p><em><span>3.   请按要求提交完整资料。</span></em></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/C7hRSXFxpOU6dJs2O9vfJUZ53FeAbKU7rSTzUjwXy5GJ7YgLZO9AAmMa9Qwibcga9tsuP6E0Y3AM6NOmHQiccMAA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/C7hRSXFxpOUN2S8cM8GdpgHH35uxbVojkx6ZVUAnvTQXAdXAywzkkaA1Q8Jdr3gpmHoSbgeAvIM4foL10IMwIA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>微信视频号</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>@香港中文大学深圳数据科学学院</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-ref